{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國新世代性感女星Sydney Sweeney出道短短幾年就已於影視界走紅，去年更推出首個內衣品牌結果同樣受歡迎，豬籠入水。</p><p>不過愈紅就愈多是非，經常因拍攝的劇集與廣告太過裸露太踩界而被鬧。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;去年拍攝</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:02:18.993470+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T14:40:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T14:59:06.888850+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:59:06.888850+00:00","content_hash":"1370d35461248732adf53e94432b92f1aec65e60dc1390cf1e01565790fd1879","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}